OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum welcomes 50,000 visitors in
OL,4,Aits first month
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull Maritime Museum has said the newly
OL,7,Frestored attraction had 50,000 visitors
OL,8,Fin its first month.
OL,10,FThe museum reopened following a #20m
OL,11,Frenovation on 8 August.
OL,13,FThe museum said there was strong public
OL,14,Finterest and visitors had travelled
OL,15,Ffrom across the region and beyond to
OL,16,Fsee the exhibitions, which celebrate
OL,17,FHull's seafaring past.
OL,19,FMike Ross, leader of Hull City Council,
OL,20,Fsaid the turnout was a "fantastic
OL,21,Fachievement".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
